  "stem": "In the \\(xy\\)-plane, line \\(k\\) passes through the points \\((-2, 8)\\) and \\((6, -4)\\). Line \\(k\\) crosses the \\(x\\)-axis at \\((a, 0)\\) and the \\(y\\)-axis at \\((0, b)\\). What is the value of \\(a + b\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "25/3"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Slope \\(= \\frac{-4 - 8}{6 - (-2)} = -\\frac{3}{2}\\). Through \\((-2, 8)\\): \\(y = -\\frac{3}{2}x + 5\\), so \\(b = 5\\).",
    "Set \\(y = 0\\): \\(x = \\frac{10}{3}\\), so \\(a = \\frac{10}{3}\\).",
    "\\(a + b = \\frac{10}{3} + 5 = \\frac{25}{3}\\)."
  ],
  "verify": "x = symbols('x')\nm = Rational(-4 - 8, 6 - (-2))\nline = m*(x + 2) + 8\nb = line.subs(x, 0)\na = solve(line, x)[0]\nassert a + b == Rational(25, 3)\nassert [Rational(s) for s in spr_answers] == [a + b]",
